  "solution": "Logic : (1st number + 3rd number) = (2nd number ÷ 5)\n\nGiven : \n\n \n• (7, 150, 23)\n\n7 + 23 = 150 ÷ 5\n\n30 = 30 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• (11, 75, 4)\n\n11 + 4 = 75 ÷ 5\n\n15 = 15 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n \n• Option - (1) : (4, 108, 16)\n\n4 + 16 = 108 ÷ 5\n\n20 ≠ 21.6 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (8, 90, 11)\n\n8 + 11 = 90 ÷ 5\n\n19 ≠ 18 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (9, 80, 11)\n\n9 + 11 = 80 ÷ 5\n\n20 ≠ 16 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (15, 140, 13)\n\n15 + 13 = 140 ÷ 5\n\n28 = 28 (LHS = RHS) \n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
